# Spec 032 (contracts/tests.md §2b): profile sync. Two Backoffice nodes on their own Postgres (postgres-sync, database
# backoffice_sync) are the target of an environment sync; the source is backoffice-api of the main pair. Read after
# env/<vendor>.env and env/extensions.env, so both sides have the same extensions and the same migration list (FR-005).
# The per-node values (PUBLIC_URL, Redis db, namespaces) are in the `environment` of each service. Test values only.
DB_HOST=postgres-sync
DB_DATABASE=backoffice_sync
DB_PASSWORD=sync-db-pass-4d1e
# Distinct values, so the no-trace checks never match an ordinary word of a log line.
ADMIN_TOKEN=sync-target-admin-token-6f2a9c1e
LOG_STYLE=raw
